    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Armor (@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbarmLeatherArm]{Leather}), Rare</em></p><p>Elite members of the Defias Brotherhood wear this armor to honor the faction’s stonemason founders. While wearing the armor, you gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong><em>Mason’s Camouflage.</em></strong> You have Advantage on Dexterity (Stealth) checks made to hide behind stone objects and structures.</p><p><strong><em>Meld into Stone.</em></strong> You can cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMeldintoSt]{Meld into Stone} from the armor. Once the armor has been used to cast this spell, it can’t be used to cast it again until the next dawn.</p>",
